# (Diamond Belt ahuman AI)

id:inner-sphere-row-0072 a oa:InnerSphereSystem, oa:Place, oa:StarSystem ;
    skos:prefLabel "(Diamond Belt ahuman AI)" .

claim:inner-sphere-inner-sphere-row-0072-c0b9c41a2ce4 a prov:Entity, oa:InnerSphereClaim ;
